 R←Test_UC_023(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;buff;stop;status;staged
⍝ Runs ]Add with a comma-separated list of files, as promised by its help.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-Tests'
 stop←0
 (rc msg buff)←stop ∆UCMD'Init "',tempDir,'" -quiet'
 msg Assert rc=0
 (⊂'one')⎕NPUT tempDir,'/one.txt'
 (⊂'two')⎕NPUT tempDir,'/two.txt'
 (⊂'three')⎕NPUT tempDir,'/three.txt'

 (rc msg buff)←stop ∆UCMD'Add one.txt,two.txt -project="',tempDir,'"'
 msg Assert rc=0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0<≢msg

 status←G.Status tempDir
 staged←(status[;1]∊'A')⌿status
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'one.txt')∊staged[;3]
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'two.txt')∊staged[;3]
 →T.GoToTidyUp(⊂'three.txt')∊staged[;3]   ⍝ This one was not mentioned, so it must not be staged

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
